WEBVTT

00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:02.960
<b>Demons.</b>

00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:09.750
<b>Matamune said they were masses of rage
and resentment that fester over time...</b>

00:00:10.170 --> 00:00:14.130
<b>And eventually take material form.</b>

00:00:15.340 --> 00:00:18.210
<b>How could I not believe it?
I'd actually seen one!</b>

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:22.850
<b>The fear I felt inside told
me it was really a demon</b>

00:00:24.350 --> 00:00:27.690
<b>Can you stand, Yoh-san?</b>

00:00:28.360 --> 00:00:29.820
<b>Y-Yeah...</b>

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:31.320
<b>Very good</b>

00:00:31.650 --> 00:00:34.450
<b>Come, Kino-san is waiting for us.</b>

00:00:34.650 --> 00:00:36.610
<b>We'd better get a move on.</b>

00:00:37.740 --> 00:00:40.040
<b>Your fiancée awaits</b>

00:00:44.750 --> 00:00:47.630
<b><i>He felt my presence...</i></b>

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:50.590
<b><i>Curse that cat.</i></b>

00:00:52.170 --> 00:00:57.010
Unyielding wish that rises in my chest

