00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:27.500
<b>Episode 31</b>

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:27.500
<b>Episode 31</b>

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:27.500
<b>Osorezan Le Voile Part 2</b>

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:27.500
<b>Osorezan Le Voile Part 2</b>

00:02:23.970 --> 00:02:25.850
<b>Wow, that scared me.</b>

00:02:25.930 --> 00:02:28.430
<b>I really thought I was dead meat.</b>

00:02:29.060 --> 00:02:34.660
<b>It's like a joke. I come to see my fiancée
and end up meeting a demon. Right, Matamune?</b>

00:02:34.770 --> 00:02:37.900
<b>Demons are no laughing matter.</b>

00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:41.240
<b>It might have killed you, Yoh-san.</b>

00:02:44.160 --> 00:02:47.500
<b>Strange things drift into
these remote northern cities.</b>

00:02:48.170 --> 00:02:49.870
<b>Strange people and ghosts.</b>

00:02:50.420 --> 00:02:53.590
<b>Hi Grandma, sorry I'm late.</b>

00:02:53.840 --> 00:02:55.250
<b>That's all right.</b>

00:02:55.340 --> 00:02:58.380
<b>Now it's your turn to wait.</b>

00:02:59.130 --> 00:03:02.220
<b>Didn't you meet your fiancée already?</b>

00:03:03.970 --> 00:03:05.310
<b>It would seem so.</b>

00:03:05.600 --> 00:03:09.980
<b>Yoh-san's description
matches that of the girl.</b>

00:03:10.730 --> 00:03:14.360
<b>I don't know what to do with her.</b>

00:03:14.480 --> 00:03:15.150
<b>What?</b>

00:03:15.520 --> 00:03:20.530
<b>I send her on a simple errand and
she doesn't come back for hours.</b>

00:03:20.860 --> 00:03:24.200
<b>And she locks herself
away in her room all the time.</b>

00:03:24.370 --> 00:03:26.450
<b>Hey, wait a minute grandma.</b>

00:03:26.870 --> 00:03:29.660
<b>Did you ever show her a picture of me?</b>

00:03:30.040 --> 00:03:34.960
<b>No, we've discussed your marriage
but I've told her nothing about you.</b>

00:03:37.300 --> 00:03:39.260
<b>That doesn't make sense!</b>

00:03:39.380 --> 00:03:41.510
<b>How did she know my...</b>

00:03:48.180 --> 00:03:51.270
<b>Well, speak of the devil.</b>

00:03:51.940 --> 00:03:53.520
<b>My fiancée is here...</b>

00:04:02.860 --> 00:04:03.820
<b>Here.</b>

00:04:09.370 --> 00:04:12.080
<b>What kind of greeting was that?!</b>

00:04:12.410 --> 00:04:14.830
<b>I believe you've been snubbed, Yoh-san.</b>

00:04:15.040 --> 00:04:16.460
<b>No kidding!</b>

00:04:16.920 --> 00:04:19.550
<b>I knew it, it was her!</b>

00:04:19.840 --> 00:04:22.470
<b>I didn't get a good
look at her face, but...</b>

00:04:22.590 --> 00:04:23.720
<b>Don't bother.</b>

00:04:24.090 --> 00:04:28.050
<b>It won't do any good to go yell at her.</b>

00:04:28.220 --> 00:04:31.640
<b>But I came all the way
to Aomori to see her...</b>

00:04:31.850 --> 00:04:36.310
<b>And she threatened to kill
me! What am I supposed to do?</b>

00:04:36.730 --> 00:04:40.860
<b>I know you wouldn't have chosen
her if she didn't have talent, but...</b>

00:04:41.480 --> 00:04:43.700
<b>You've spoiled her.</b>

00:04:43.950 --> 00:04:44.950
<b>Fool.</b>

00:04:46.950 --> 00:04:51.040
<b>Words mean nothing to Anna.</b>

00:04:54.410 --> 00:04:57.130
<b><i>I just don't get it.</i></b>

00:04:58.000 --> 00:05:01.090
<b>Is she deaf or something?</b>

00:05:01.630 --> 00:05:05.130
<b>And how did she know who I was?</b>

00:05:05.800 --> 00:05:10.050
<b>And why doesn't Anna like me?</b>

00:05:10.710 --> 00:05:13.350
<b>Yoh-san experiencing
love at first sight, eh?</b>

00:05:14.850 --> 00:05:16.640
<b>No, you idiot Matamune!</b>

00:05:16.730 --> 00:05:18.480
<b>I didn't mean it like that!</b>

00:05:18.650 --> 00:05:20.270
<b>Don't be ashamed.</b>

00:05:20.860 --> 00:05:24.990
<b>It's good to be attracted to one's betrothed.</b>

00:05:25.490 --> 00:05:27.200
<b>But she told me to die.</b>

00:05:28.320 --> 00:05:30.870
<b>Does she not want to get married?</b>

00:05:31.530 --> 00:05:33.620
<b>Or does she dislike me?</b>

00:05:33.870 --> 00:05:39.830
<b>There's nothing to worry about,
you've only just met each other.</b>

00:05:40.790 --> 00:05:42.050
<b>Hey, Matamune.</b>

00:05:43.250 --> 00:05:45.840
<b>Why did that demon try to kill me?</b>

00:05:46.630 --> 00:05:50.010
<b>You think it had
anything to do with her?</b>

00:05:50.550 --> 00:05:51.890
<b><i>He's perceptive</i></b>

00:05:52.140 --> 00:05:55.100
<b><i>I suppose I shouldn't be surprised.</i></b>

00:05:55.520 --> 00:05:56.890
<b><i>Blood will tell.</i></b>

00:05:58.020 --> 00:06:00.310
<b>As I said before...</b>

00:06:00.340 --> 00:06:02.980
<b>They are embodiments of
resentment and regret...</b>

00:06:03.360 --> 00:06:06.240
<b>But how do they achieve material form?</b>

00:06:06.800 --> 00:06:10.960
<b>Demons are unable to direct their
anger at the true object of their wrath.</b>

00:06:12.700 --> 00:06:15.620
<b>So they're picking on me
because I can see them?</b>

00:06:16.080 --> 00:06:17.080
<b>Exactly.</b>

00:06:17.910 --> 00:06:24.420
<b>And sometimes normal humans possess
the sixth sense that Shamans have.</b>

00:06:25.050 --> 00:06:27.260
<b>That's why demons are dangerous.</b>

00:06:27.760 --> 00:06:29.300
<b>A grudge, huh?</b>

00:06:29.510 --> 00:06:32.890
<b>It's not good to dwell on bad stuff.</b>

00:06:33.050 --> 00:06:35.520
<b>They should just get over it.</b>

00:06:38.640 --> 00:06:42.230
<b>I often wish that I could just
get over the things I've done.</b>

00:06:42.860 --> 00:06:44.860
<b>Matamune?</b>

00:06:45.610 --> 00:06:47.690
<b>Our reasons may differ...</b>

00:06:48.440 --> 00:06:52.030
<b>But the more we try to forget...</b>

00:06:52.490 --> 00:06:56.040
<b>And the more we struggle,
the more we become entangled.</b>

00:06:56.620 --> 00:07:01.250
<b>Soon the memory becomes a curse.</b>

00:07:02.250 --> 00:07:04.210
<b>And it breaks your heart.</b>

00:07:09.550 --> 00:07:13.220
<b>Our reasons may differ, hmm...</b>

00:07:13.850 --> 00:07:16.060
<b>But what does he mean with "our"...</b>

00:07:16.430 --> 00:07:18.180
<b>It's still bothering me...</b>

00:07:18.390 --> 00:07:20.850
<b>Did he mean his and Anna's?</b>

00:07:21.730 --> 00:07:24.400
<b>It's no use, I can't sleep at all!</b>

00:07:24.900 --> 00:07:29.620
<b>Hey Matamune, tell me the truth!
You know what's going on, don't you?</b>

00:07:34.820 --> 00:07:36.780
<b><i>I guess... some ghosts sleep?</i></b>

00:07:38.410 --> 00:07:40.290
<b><i>I didn't know that.</i></b>

00:07:40.650 --> 00:07:44.280
Mitarai

00:07:41.160 --> 00:07:44.080
<b><i>It's almost like he's not even a ghost.</i></b>

00:07:44.280 --> 00:07:47.410
Mitarai

00:07:44.580 --> 00:07:46.920
<b><i>He takes baths and sleeps on a futon.</i></b>

00:07:47.710 --> 00:07:51.590
<b><i>How can he take up space
under a blanket if he's a ghost?</i></b>

00:07:54.140 --> 00:07:54.840
<b>Die.</b>

00:07:55.140 --> 00:07:56.180
<b>Die.</b>

00:07:57.810 --> 00:08:02.810
<b><i>Matamune didn't answer when I asked
about the link between Anna and that demon.</i></b>

00:08:03.690 --> 00:08:05.980
<b><i>Maybe he doesn't
want to talk about it.</i></b>

00:08:08.480 --> 00:08:10.110
<b><i>A thousand black paper cranes.</i></b>

00:08:10.940 --> 00:08:16.780
<b><i>Each night she patiently bears
the endless mystery in solitude.</i></b>

00:08:18.200 --> 00:08:19.580
<b><i>Not folding.</i></b>

00:08:19.610 --> 00:08:21.290
<b><i>Not folding.</i></b>

00:08:24.210 --> 00:08:26.330
<b>Alright, let's go!</b>

00:08:27.790 --> 00:08:29.500
<b>Is it new years already?</b>

00:08:29.920 --> 00:08:33.880
<b>That's right, tonight is New years eve.</b>

00:08:35.130 --> 00:08:40.970
<b>The Shaman Fight that comes around
every 500 years, is almost at hand.</b>

00:08:42.310 --> 00:08:45.100
<b>It seems we have no choice.</b>

00:08:45.940 --> 00:08:50.110
<b>This may be the Asakuras' last chance.</b>

00:08:50.440 --> 00:08:54.530
<b>My Grandson is his twin brother,
though you'd never know it.</b>

00:08:55.360 --> 00:08:59.990
<b>Powerful Furyoku is required
to awaken powerful Furyoku.</b>

00:09:00.830 --> 00:09:05.210
<b>That's why I chose that
girl to become his wife.</b>

00:09:05.870 --> 00:09:10.670
<b>Yoh must defeat Hao at all costs.</b>

00:09:12.510 --> 00:09:13.630
<b>That's right...</b>

00:09:16.340 --> 00:09:17.970
<b>I'm in a pinch...</b>

00:09:18.380 --> 00:09:23.600
<b>I have absolutely no idea what to
get for grandpa, mom and Tamao.</b>

00:09:21.000 --> 00:09:22.500
Shimokita Peninsula Expectant

00:09:24.390 --> 00:09:28.810
<b>Souvenirs have to be chosen
carefully. Plus grandpa's really picky.</b>

00:09:29.150 --> 00:09:31.320
<b>What would he like?</b>

