<b><i>That's why you told me to go?</i></b>

00:12:48.870 --> 00:12:50.960
<b>Shimokita Motors</b>

00:12:49.600 --> 00:12:50.680
<b><i>I don't understand.</i></b>

00:12:54.060 --> 00:12:55.020
<b><i>I'm scared!</i></b>

00:12:58.230 --> 00:13:01.530
<b>I-I-It's coming!</b>

00:13:07.160 --> 00:13:09.370
<b>Help me!</b>

00:13:09.450 --> 00:13:11.080
<b>It's always like this.</b>

00:13:12.790 --> 00:13:17.250
<b>Whenever I go outside, demons appear.
They do bad things and then they disappear.</b>

00:13:17.630 --> 00:13:19.840
<b>That's why I stay in my room.</b>

00:13:20.340 --> 00:13:23.760
<b>What, you mean you're not doing this?!</b>

00:13:26.760 --> 00:13:29.930
<b>Then where are the demons coming from?!</b>

00:13:30.300 --> 00:13:32.890
<b>You're the demon, you hoodlum!</b>

00:13:34.140 --> 00:13:36.600
<b>I thought I heard a ruckus!</b>

00:13:36.850 --> 00:13:41.020
<b>You smashed my storefront, you rotten punk!</b>

00:13:41.650 --> 00:13:44.940
<b>As founder and owner
of Gu-chan's souvenirs...</b>

00:13:44.960 --> 00:13:49.280
<b>I, former captain Gumakura
Isao, shall bring you to justice!</b>

00:13:50.780 --> 00:13:53.290
<b>Now is not the time for this!</b>

00:13:55.000 --> 00:13:56.680
<b><i>Come to think of it...</i></b>

00:13:56.700 --> 00:13:59.290
<b><i>How did it break the
glass, isn't it a ghost?</i></b>

00:13:59.920 --> 00:14:02.920
<b><i>Wait, don't tell me it's a physical body?</i></b>

00:14:03.300 --> 00:14:04.710
<b><i>It's like Matamune!</i></b>

00:14:05.760 --> 00:14:07.470
<b><i>But this doesn't make sense.</i></b>

00:14:10.720 --> 00:14:13.430
<b><i>Ghosts can't affect matter!</i></b>

00:14:15.390 --> 00:14:18.440
<b>The glass broke by itself!</b>

00:14:19.140 --> 00:14:20.940
<b>This must be an evil spirit!</b>

00:14:22.940 --> 00:14:27.950
<b>Boy, did you save me from an evil spirit?</b>

00:14:28.280 --> 00:14:31.240
<b>Well, actually it's
me he's trying to kill...</b>

00:14:31.870 --> 00:14:35.950
<b>But it's an evil spirit, all right.</b>

00:14:37.410 --> 00:14:41.880
<b>If it can break stuff,
then maybe I can break it.</b>

00:14:42.250 --> 00:14:44.880
<b>That sword has a sharp edge, boy!</b>

00:14:44.960 --> 00:14:46.130
<b>So you want to fight?!</b>

00:14:46.840 --> 00:14:47.760
<b>That's nuts!</b>

00:14:48.630 --> 00:14:52.140
<b>Asakura Yoh, you'd
dare to fight a demon?</b>

00:14:52.760 --> 00:14:54.560
<b>Don't you have any fear?</b>

00:14:55.890 --> 00:14:56.970
<b>Why don't you run?</b>

00:14:58.020 --> 00:14:59.480
<b>Run away, Anna!</b>

00:15:01.190 --> 00:15:03.110
<b>I'll take care of the demon!</b>

00:15:03.310 --> 00:15:06.280
<b>Run back to grandma's
house and get Matamune!</b>

00:15:07.360 --> 00:15:09.240
<b>But that sword...</b>

00:15:10.360 --> 00:15:12.660
<b>A demon can only be
defeated by a demon.</b>

00:15:13.570 --> 00:15:14.580
<b><i>Run...</i></b>

00:15:16.540 --> 00:15:18.620
<b><i>Run away, Asakura Yoh!</i></b>

00:15:19.460 --> 00:15:21.580
<b>Get out of its way, Yoh!</b>

00:15:25.000 --> 00:15:27.920
<b><i>The instant the sword made contact...</i></b>

00:15:28.760 --> 00:15:33.010
<b><i>Anna cried out and the
demon split back into the wisps.</i></b>

00:15:34.140 --> 00:15:36.910
<b><i>But the one looking more
confused than anyone...</i></b>

00:15:37.850 --> 00:15:39.810
<b><i>Was Anna herself.</i></b>

00:15:43.520 --> 00:15:45.860
<b>Is there anything wrong, Matamune?</b>

00:15:46.270 --> 00:15:47.360
<b>What?</b>

00:15:47.780 --> 00:15:49.440
<b>You don't have to pretend.</b>

00:15:49.690 --> 00:15:56.030
<b>Your thoughts just turned to the
enemy we have to defeat. To him.</b>

00:15:56.560 --> 00:15:58.660
<b>No, my thoughts didn't turn to him.</b>

00:15:59.450 --> 00:16:05.920
<b>Because my thoughts are
on him every waking moment.</b>

00:16:07.000 --> 00:16:11.130
<b>You're a real piece of work, aren't you?</b>

00:16:11.880 --> 00:16:16.390
<b>Will you always be tormented
by that day 500 years ago...</b>

00:16:16.720 --> 00:16:21.520
<b>When you delivered the finishing blow to
your former master in the Shaman Fight?</b>

00:16:22.230 --> 00:16:24.690
<b>Do you think I regret doing it?</b>

00:16:24.940 --> 00:16:26.270
<b>Am I wrong?</b>

00:16:27.270 --> 00:16:33.320
<b>Isn't that why you haven't
been able to rest in peace?</b>

00:16:39.870 --> 00:16:42.620
<b><i>He carries on bravely
but the smile is there.</i></b>

00:16:43.580 --> 00:16:46.080
<b><i>Unexplained longing for mementos.</i></b>

00:16:47.000 --> 00:16:51.000
<b><i>Love is hellos, goodbyes and Gossamer.</i></b>

00:16:51.760 --> 00:16:53.800
<b><i>Osorezan Le Voile.</i></b>

00:16:55.760 --> 00:16:57.550
<b>It's only natural...</b>

00:16:58.350 --> 00:17:01.100
<b>Why did I do that to him?</b>

00:17:02.600 --> 00:17:08.730
<b>I can never forget the feelings of
respect I have for Asakura Hao-sama.</b>

00:17:11.980 --> 00:17:13.110
<b>Cold today.</b>

00:17:13.440 --> 00:17:14.820
<b>Yes, it is.</b>

00:17:15.150 --> 00:17:19.240
<b>But worse than the cold,
is the stench of corpses.</b>

00:17:19.700 --> 00:17:20.990
<b>It's horrendous.</b>

00:17:21.450 --> 00:17:27.540
<b>The poor can't afford to burn their dead,
so they dump them in the Kamo river.</b>

00:17:28.290 --> 00:17:34.340
<b>The streets are filed with waste, plagues ravage
the land and the dead rot where they fall.</b>

00:17:35.260 --> 00:17:38.140
<b>The sick are driven out to die like dogs.</b>

00:17:38.930 --> 00:17:43.020
<b>Those horrors have become so
common. These are truly dark times.</b>

00:17:47.230 --> 00:17:49.400
<b>There won't be any, will there?</b>

00:17:50.110 --> 00:17:51.320
<b>Any what?</b>

00:17:51.820 --> 00:17:53.730
<b>You know, ghosts and demons.</b>

00:17:54.110 --> 00:17:55.860
<b>Look where we are...</b>

00:17:56.200 --> 00:17:58.070
<b>Hahaha, stop that...</b>

00:17:58.530 --> 00:18:00.740
<b>And even if there were...</b>

00:18:02.370 --> 00:18:04.040
<b>There it is!</b>

00:18:07.920 --> 00:18:08.830
<b>A cat.</b>

00:18:09.330 --> 00:18:13.250
<b>How dare you scare people like that?!</b>

00:18:13.380 --> 00:18:16.590
<b>And how dare you make your
home in the bones of a human?!</b>

00:18:16.760 --> 00:18:18.220
<b>I'll have your head!</b>

00:18:18.340 --> 00:18:19.720
<b>Stop it</b>

00:18:20.050 --> 00:18:22.710
<b>The small creature's life is precious, too.</b>

00:18:22.930 --> 00:18:24.930
<b>Don't take lives unnecessarily.</b>

00:18:25.430 --> 00:18:28.270
<b>But it's just a filthy stray cat.</b>

00:18:28.480 --> 00:18:30.100
<b>Isn't that impressive?</b>

00:18:34.860 --> 00:18:40.610
<b>Demons infest this city like
lice, yet he lives here without fear.</b>

00:18:43.410 --> 00:18:48.710
<b>Little one, your mother abandoned you and
your seven brothers and sisters have perished.</b>

00:18:49.160 --> 00:18:54.090
<b>Now the pestilence has infected you
as well, and soon you will succumb.</b>

00:18:55.710 --> 00:18:58.050
<b>But what a brave little soul.</b>

00:18:58.610 --> 00:19:02.330
<b>You have the ability to see demons,
yet you do not flee from them.</b>

00:19:02.350 --> 00:19:04.970
<b>How can I forsake you?</b>

00:19:06.100 --> 00:19:08.810
<b>Yes, I know you can see them.</b>

00:19:09.690 --> 00:19:11.810
<b>Come into my arms.</b>

00:19:21.820 --> 00:19:24.280
<b>Attended by spirits that
even the demons feared...</b>

00:19:24.950 --> 00:19:28.160
<b>Through his abilities, he
contributed greatly to society.</b>

00:19:28.250 --> 00:19:32.500
<b>The great Onmyoji, Asakura Hao.</b>

00:19:33.130 --> 00:19:36.380
<b>No heart was ever more
filled with compassion than his.</b>

00:19:36.880 --> 00:19:39.840
<b>Hmph, is compassion the right word?</b>

00:19:40.420 --> 00:19:43.300
<b>You helped to defeat him.</b>

00:19:44.180 --> 00:19:48.770
<b>You and Asakura Yohken the
ascetic, defeated him 500 years ago.</b>

00:19:49.100 --> 00:19:51.560
<b>Back when Hao was reincarnated as a patch.</b>

00:19:52.770 --> 00:19:54.480
<b>But Hao-sama has a kind heart.</b>

00:19:55.110 --> 00:20:01.200
<b>It was because of his kindness and his powerful
Furyoku that his soul was consumed by demons.</b>

00:20:01.640 --> 00:20:03.640
Reishi

00:20:01.640 --> 00:20:03.640
Reishi

00:20:02.490 --> 00:20:03.410
<b>Reishi.</b>

00:20:04.360 --> 00:20:07.330
<b>Without them saying a word...</b>

00:20:07.830 --> 00:20:11.460
<b>He felt what others felt
and heard their thoughts.</b>

00:20:12.330 --> 00:20:16.960
<b>But his power was uncontrollable, the rage
and resentment of others streamed into him...</b>

00:20:17.750 --> 00:20:22.090
<b>like a poisonous torrent
that corroded his soul...</b>

00:20:22.420 --> 00:20:25.220
<b>Until ultimately he
spawned demons of his own.</b>

00:20:26.550 --> 00:20:30.810
<b>The word "Heian" means "peace and tranquility".
It belies the horrors of that time.</b>

00:20:31.350 --> 00:20:37.360
<b>People suffered terribly because of the
nobles' insatiable greed and hunger for power.</b>

00:20:37.480 --> 00:20:41.400
<b>Hao-sama saw humanity at its worst.</b>

00:20:43.150 --> 00:20:46.570
<b>So that's why Hao is trying
to become the Shaman King.</b>

00:20:47.740 --> 00:20:50.300
<b>But it's not kindness that drives him.</b>

00:20:50.330 --> 00:20:51.540
<b>It's weakness.</b>

00:20:54.080 --> 00:20:58.380
<b>Hao was defeated by his own weak heart.</b>

00:20:59.420 --> 00:21:03.920
<b>You knew this when you fought him, Matamune.</b>

00:21:05.010 --> 00:21:09.850
<b>Yes, and I do not intend
to question the justice of it.</b>

00:21:10.850 --> 00:21:11.970
<b>And yet...</b>

00:21:12.720 --> 00:21:19.770
<b>And yet I regret that I was forced to
choose between justice and my master.</b>

00:21:21.020 --> 00:21:25.650
<b>Well, I don't profess to know what's right.</b>

00:21:26.410 --> 00:21:30.080
<b>But I do know what's wrong.</b>

00:21:31.370 --> 00:21:35.710
<b>Think about why you're here.</b>

00:21:36.040 --> 00:21:39.330
<b>You need to come to terms with your own past.</b>

00:21:40.040 --> 00:21:45.550
<b>And you must save the girl. She
has the same power that Hao had.</b>

00:21:46.340 --> 00:21:49.550
<b>The power to see into people's hearts.</b>

00:21:49.800 --> 00:21:51.850
<b>She was abandoned
because of her gift</b>

00:21:51.930 --> 00:21:54.350
<b>She has grown to hate and avoid people.</b>

00:21:54.380 --> 00:21:56.780
<b>And her bad feelings
materialize as demons.</b>

00:21:57.270 --> 00:22:01.690
<b>Yoh needs your help to open her heart.</b>

00:22:04.570 --> 00:22:06.320
<b><i><i>A ghost for a thousand years.</i></i></b>

00:22:06.820 --> 00:22:10.910
<b><i><i>I will finally discard these lonely tears.</i></i></b>

00:22:11.580 --> 00:22:12.860
<b>If only for a time.</b>

00:22:12.880 --> 00:22:14.450
<b>If only for a time.</b>

